Ever since Nya first knew what BPD was, she knew she should have it. Just like she knew ever since she was a kid that she shouldn’t be just half-japanese. But she never had words for it… until she was sadly scrolling through the search result for BPD on tumblr and one simple little term popped up… TransBPD. Turns out, TransIDs explained a whole lot of her experiences.
OR;
Nya’s TransID discovery journey as a TransBPD person. Also explores the dynamic of Kai and Nya as kids raising themselves + how it affects them & their relationships silently.
